      <g:title>Impulse Anvil – Convolution &amp; Impulse Response Design VST3 for Windows</g:title>
      <g:short_title>Impulse Anvil – Convolution &amp; IR Design VST3</g:short_title>
      <g:description>Impulse Anvil is a Windows 10/11 64-bit VST3 effect for designing the response your track passes through while you hear it in real time. Build from two IRs, recordings or found sounds; shape 21 Morph relationships; use Draw, Path, Glue and Omni; refine Color, Texture, Edit, EQ and Output; save the complete Anvil setup as a preset; and optionally Bake the designed response as a reusable WAV. Anvil includes its own stereo convolution engine, so no separate IR loader is required. The full license is a one-time €49 purchase with two activation seats and 126 included IRs.</g:description>
